sender alice basic
sender bob pro
sender cora bulk
recipient rx
recipient ny tz=-05:00
recipient tokyo tz=+09:00
set-for ny quiet.start 22:00
set-for ny quiet.end 07:00
set-for tokyo limit.daily 1
at d0 04:00
send q1 alice ny ttl=12h Good night message
send q2 bob ny prio=urgent Wake up, the build is on fire
send l1 cora tokyo first today
send l2 cora tokyo ttl=12h second today
advance 10s
at d0 12:00
at d0 15:00:05
inbox ny
inbox tokyo
config ny
